            <div xml:id="m-e357352b-cf3b-4eb8-be82-cf32712e75b2">
              <lg xml:id="m-d2596aee-44ef-464e-baa0-cf9d8bf0ac7c">
                <l xml:id="m-6e016601-cf7e-4c04-b6ca-d0ff5f9c8364" facs="#m-f127d273-5efb-4b56-80ad-f4cc7d230b00" label="ambiguous">77e1</l><l xml:id="m-a1ecf505-9e20-48cb-9a6a-1168f5224659" facs="#m-47bc40e7-5dc8-4b96-9c23-ca182e9567a9" label="text-like">The Paschal Vigll</l><l xml:id="m-b45be06b-5baf-4734-9fa4-8a3bd9f3fbe6" facs="#m-2c2019ab-6ad1-461a-b0b9-a50efbcb83df" label="text-like">11. When the deacon lor priestl has entered the church, he stands erect</l><l xml:id="m-1661aadd-f2c7-4088-b570-5f9bec6ff1e8" facs="#m-85676c06-7ecd-416c-ab14-2ab433c1055c" label="text-like">and sings alone:</l><l xml:id="m-64d9eab2-98e9-4f51-8573-9a73f8c68dcb" facs="#m-2ac49491-131d-4d92-83b9-5e1fadc46517" label="lyrics-like">Lúmen Chrí-sti.</l><l xml:id="m-5f39b304-6c4d-42dd-ace2-1534bc76954a" facs="#m-86be68b0-d718-4cba-8be4-68bccca01d27" label="text-like">All the others except the subdeacon Ior-cross-bearerl and thurifer hneel</l><l xml:id="m-0b7c9e84-0552-4b34-bb58-06f60f2d861c" facs="#m-b2bc01fe-63da-4884-ac94-ce56eeaa88e4" label="text-like">towards the paschal candle and answer:</l><l xml:id="m-92bf79ff-d274-458b-9020-1a402c7fb349" facs="#m-1732e91a-314f-4428-b37f-963a28b56428" label="lyrics-like">W. Dé-o grá-ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-744040ec-310d-4fec-9fb2-a98399af38f7" facs="#m-a44a0131-4c47-4cff-8948-cc8f2850610e" label="text-like">All rise, and the celebrant lights his oun candle from the paschal candle</l><l xml:id="m-1349dc86-2a6c-42a8-8b67-3f621996fb4c" facs="#m-d94233c2-50cd-4c99-a220-ab3a357102f6" label="text-like">la server lights a candle for the priestl.</l><l xml:id="m-ef840f76-f747-4434-b19f-b03fb3ce8068" facs="#m-db91034c-2179-4d26-9d35-7c5a5dbe7d68" label="text-like">The deacon Ior priestl goes to the middle of the church, and sines there</l><l xml:id="m-fb6bafbf-e999-41d8-a80d-a0a312c72d30" facs="#m-ad21e774-a28b-425c-9246-2c72e210c39b" label="text-like">in the same way but in a higher hey:</l><l xml:id="m-b6aa34db-9162-402b-a283-42e28e3a4a8c" facs="#m-a50570d0-85f7-4eac-82a9-073d24f062f1" label="ambiguous">LUMEN CHRISTI</l><l xml:id="m-5cc902ec-a8e7-4636-8bac-b813fe4f416a" facs="#m-3757ee95-4a68-4526-b9d9-d55e4fb90321" label="text-like">Then all hneel and answer as before:</l><l xml:id="m-cfa0ad66-eb14-4d8a-93cf-4de46bf435de" facs="#m-ea9b01ed-61b6-4a9a-9cb9-49f8e6374f18" label="ambiguous">DEO GRATIAS</l><l xml:id="m-6e5de2ac-dd64-414f-a956-d63be6bb3dc6" facs="#m-408ba14a-e422-4be6-899c-95408cbc818d" label="text-like">The candles of the clergy lor serversl are then lit from the paschal candle.</l><l xml:id="m-22e7e362-051a-46c1-87de-5686fc6f0ccb" facs="#m-f8c06ce1-0815-43fd-b2e8-160ed911cffb" label="text-like">The third time he goes in front of the altar, in the middle of the choir,</l><l xml:id="m-e02c3feb-4071-4ecc-9f3e-9cc9d1afbdef" facs="#m-2911c0fe-c1b1-49fd-b65f-48cde17d2664" label="text-like">and again sines in a still higher hey:</l><l xml:id="m-473bd059-1291-44fe-8e46-71b88027cf6d" facs="#m-14d5f9aa-32cf-44cc-ad51-6107c5990769" label="ambiguous">LUMEN CHRISTI</l><l xml:id="m-ed927cdd-456f-4fae-95dd-9a9cbcbe2ee6" facs="#m-4651ba86-bdee-4ab7-b34b-3c1558e251bb" label="text-like">All hneel a third time, and answer:</l><l xml:id="m-940af0b9-79f7-4e6c-bd77-47eda9c71242" facs="#m-81302543-e539-475f-b80f-29c006d8e13d" label="ambiguous">DEO GRATIAS</l><l xml:id="m-4f2f358d-1736-4c32-bfa0-5ca78213e453" facs="#m-57c7a6bf-f520-44b3-8e84-624b8139d4f3" label="text-like">The candles of the faithful and the lamps of the church are then lit from</l><l xml:id="m-9ab5045f-bd9c-4699-a3ce-5670b1119e2d" facs="#m-678ee958-262b-49bc-ab5b-93b40be699be" label="text-like">the paschal candle.</l><l xml:id="m-a6353d25-7897-4d0d-8d92-74feadfb3ef7" facs="#m-97e5c043-3dc9-462e-a6ed-517f9c7653b6" label="text-like">THE PASCHAL PRAISE</l><l xml:id="m-8e7148f3-d8be-4c11-9784-54edb78f38c3" facs="#m-6eea9807-5238-4da4-834e-3f9567cbcec2" label="ambiguous">Solemn rite</l><l xml:id="m-6d5c7f04-8e17-4b76-970d-f7dfd46f5632" facs="#m-fa905ede-7b40-46d6-a918-e3ad8cee84fd" label="text-like">12. The celebrant then goes to his place in choir on the Epistle side; the</l><l xml:id="m-0e2814e3-1258-48cd-a5de-5be6412b7121" facs="#m-2588c693-a74a-446b-8b9f-e3c6caa7bf8a" label="text-like">subaeacon vith the cross stands on the Gospel side, behind the lectern; the</l><l xml:id="m-f4a048fc-399d-4838-8fd4-41544e7906c0" facs="#m-fea1a984-d5b5-479c-a02f-0cd117957b99" label="text-like">cergy tahe their places in the stalls.</l><l xml:id="m-51eb06e2-f209-4f05-b2a7-a26fdb135fa8" facs="#m-bd2a0e00-c5ee-400e-970a-071bee301b84" label="text-like">The deacon places the paschal candle on a small stand in the middle of the</l><l xml:id="m-8f1b1e27-f583-4d2e-be89-5736c4a89ff5" facs="#m-80bd538d-1901-48e2-9b9c-43b29f8a24c6" label="text-like">choir, and when the celebrant has put incense in the thurible, the deacon</l><l xml:id="m-fcc95e37-dd3c-4558-a856-3736ec549fee" facs="#m-88199a79-26c5-4153-9c6c-6034e0391dd5" label="text-like">tahes the book and ases for a blessing in these words:</l><l xml:id="m-3e041b95-f15e-4358-9e84-d0fdf642a5e2" facs="#m-b2364c67-0dce-4c35-a320-d29670ff1be4" label="ambiguous">Jube, domne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-27ba484f-1788-401d-8e44-75f8f974e427" facs="#m-43694e07-9109-4cd5-9906-e0e1982a4560" label="text-like">The celebrant answers:</l><l xml:id="m-16ac312b-c22e-41d7-9da4-5fb79eb90b09" facs="#m-30eeb56e-73e3-4eb3-ada7-841159b4fdf5" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus sit in corde tuo, et schâle praecónium: In nómine</l><l xml:id="m-69a52487-3a6e-47f7-ad4c-2f5fa2e72a21" facs="#m-66a20e59-1778-4cbb-8dea-eb69769d09bf" label="lyrics-like">in lábiis tuis, ut digne et com-Patris, et Fili,  et Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-94ed3fe4-e94a-47be-b5c2-a4716f11aca3" facs="#m-703effe7-d7ef-4ece-81ab-41779ba8e81a" label="lyrics-like">peténter annúnties suum pa-lSancti. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-f4606b5c-b342-44fb-811e-3fc5caa229c5" facs="#m-77e7f67e-fc09-4efc-b51e-1f431683084b" label="ambiguous">Simple rite</l><l xml:id="m-a0cc897b-9c24-4602-b375-6712f1a8edc2" facs="#m-04a48653-0124-4446-a22a-18769aa6d3ac" label="text-like">Iln the sanctuary, the thurifer stands near the credence-table and the</l><l xml:id="m-06f1aeb8-bdc5-4692-8943-3b4f80f9784b" facs="#m-e671ce65-5e3d-46a3-a981-f090b82a7e32" label="text-like">cross-bearer on the Gospel side facing the lectern; the celebrant puts the</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>